OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry with sunny
OL,6,Fintervals, but there is a risk of some
OL,7,Fshowers first thing, these mainly near
OL,8,FKent and dying out during the morning.
OL,9,FWinds falling light, and feeling warm
OL,10,Fin the sunshine.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA dry evening with sunny
OL,13,Fspells, then remaining dry with clear
OL,14,Fspells overnight. Wind perhaps picking
OL,15,Fup a little by dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FDry with sunny spells for
OL,18,Fmuch of the day. Cloud perhaps
OL,19,Fthickening in the north later in the
OL,20,Fday with a few spots of rain here.
OL,21,FBecoming breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
