OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled during this period, with a
OL,7,Fmixture of rain or showers and drier
OL,8,Fintervals with sunny spells.
OL,9,FOccasionally breezy. Warm temperatures
OL,10,Fat first, trending near normal on
OL,11,FTuesday.
